name: An inactive saved architecture stays distinct from accepted Map in scope planning
size: 120x36
cwd: @TARGET
require-shell: test -f @TARGET/.kuzushi/v3/campaigns/monorepo-scope-architecture-20261025/plan.json
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/monorepo-scope-live-20261025/attempt-2/operator-home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NODE_OPTIONS=--import=@REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/deny_provider_transport.mjs KUZUSHI_TEST_DENIED_FETCH_LOG=@ART/denied-fetch.jsonl
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_context_preflight.py @TARGET @ART inspect
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: campaign monorepo-scope-architecture-20261025
require-live-snap: 25 monorepo-scope-architecture-20261025 | fixed-plan
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 SUGGEST SCAN SCOPES | saved-context-form
expect: exact saved revision
expect-not: exact accepted Map revision
expect: reasoning: low
ask: Does this fixed scope plan distinguish the inactive saved architecture from Map acceptance, while making its model, effort and one-job boundary clear before any approval?
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 SUGGEST SCAN SCOPES | plan-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 SUGGEST SCAN SCOPES | plan-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 SUGGEST SCAN SCOPES | plan-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 SUGGEST SCAN SCOPES | plan-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 SUGGEST SCAN SCOPES | plan-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: plan-end-40x12
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 15 EXACT GENERATION OPTIONS | exact-options-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: exact-options-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: exact-options-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: exact-options-page-3-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: exact-options-page-4-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: exact-options-page-5-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: exact-options-page-6-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: exact-options-page-7-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: exact-options-page-8-40x12
ask: Can the operator inspect the saved context and exact frozen options through all six sizes using visible reading controls without approving allowance or launching the job?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_context_preflight.py @TARGET @ART inspected
resize: 120x36
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/monorepo-scope-live-20261025/attempt-2/operator-home NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NODE_OPTIONS=--import=@REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/deny_provider_transport.mjs KUZUSHI_TEST_DENIED_FETCH_LOG=@ART/denied-fetch.jsonl
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: campaign monorepo-scope-architecture-20261025
require-live-snap: 25 monorepo-scope-architecture-20261025 | recovered-plan
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 SUGGEST SCAN SCOPES | recovered-saved-context
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_context_preflight.py @TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the exact unapproved plan and inactive context, with no findings, provider requests or accidental Map acceptance?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
